    <releases>
        <release date="2025-08-11" version="1.2.0">Expansion Pack for 3-Phase 3-Level Vienna rectifier PFC Application

The package works only with .ioc projects generated by eDesign-Suite Digital Power Workbench Vienna Rectifire web solution.

The URL to access eDesignSuite Digital Power Workbench is https://eds.st.com/eds-console/#/digital-power-workbench 

To start directly a Vienna Rectifier design use 

https://eds.st.com/vienna/?msg={"data":{"application":"vienna_html","specs":{"ic":"stm32g474retx:vienna","input":{"v":{"min":185,"max":265},"f":50},"output":[{"v":800,"r":2,"i":18.75}]}},"action":"new_design"}

Generated with STM32PackCreator 4.0.0</release>
